\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Failure-aware retry with dual action spaces. Relative and absolute predictions agree during nominal execution but diverge when a recoverable deviation drives the rollout OOD, exposing an endogenous disagreement score $D_t$. Relative actions provide precise local motion, whereas absolute waypoints bring the robot back toward a demonstrated execution path for retry.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
